BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:web:bridgeland-mainstreet-celebration-0919@bridgeland-events
DTSTAMP:20260919T143041Z
DTSTART:20260919T170000Z
DTEND:20260919T210000Z
SUMMARY:Bridgeland Main Street Community Celebration
DESCRIPTION:Free celebration marking the end of the Bridgeland Main Stree
 t construction — now with no more road closures or detours. In La Piazza
  (by Starbucks): live music, local giveaways — including a $1,000 gift-c
 ard basket from local businesses (stop by, say hi and enter to win) — fa
 ce painting, family-friendly activities and food. Open to everyone. Anno
 unced by the BRCA page; official details: calgary.ca/planning/projects/b
 ridgeland-main-street.html | Cost: Free | Area: bridgeland | Source: BRC
 A page | https://www.facebook.com/BRCACalgary/
LOCATION:La Piazza, 945 General Ave NE, Calgary
END:VEVENT
